<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Houses</h1>
<p>Some players have a house of their own in Valhalla: a room or a few, 
somewhere in the world, made for them by the gods. Houses are not for 
sale; nothing in Valhalla is.
</p><p>If you'd like a house, you can ask the gods for one. Tell them where it 
should stand and how it fits in there, and what each room looks like: 
its title, its description, and the things in it a visitor can look 
at. For more than one room, draw a plan with the entrance as room 1:
</p>
<pre>    4-5
    |
  2-1-3
</pre>
<p>Whether a house is made, and when, is up to the gods.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Map</a>
</pre>




</div>